,"source":"Edition Peters vocal score (Edition Peters Nr. 4474, plate 11446, edited by Georg Schünemann), pages 63–64, the recitative between No. 9 and No. 10 (17 bars)","author":"Kurt Soldan (1891–1946), piano reduction","licence":"Public domain","notes":"Written out from the printed pages: sung lines and piano each read by two independent readers, every disagreement settled on the page by a judge, then checked bar by bar by a fresh checker (notes clean; one word break fixed in bar 17, me gli a-mi-ci). The German singing translation is left out, and a handwritten pencil correction over bar 14 is ignored. The last bar leads straight into No. 10 (attacca). Playback tempo ♩ = 64, a speaking pace for secco recitative, from Rattle (1:05) and Klemperer (1:03); Mozart gives no tempo."},{"item":"IPA, gloss and translation","source":"Written for this app (from the app's reviewed Così libretto drafts)","author":"Counterpart development team","licence":"CC0 1.0","notes":"Unreviewed by a diction coach."}],"files":{"musicxml":"score.musicxml","language":"language.json"},"importedAt":"2026-11-12T15:01:47.103Z"}